      "content": "Thanks for that. Could you get a bit more specific on the wear and tear aspect? Specifically, I'm worried about how these surfaces handle heavy foot traffic over a 10-year period—like scratching, scuffing, or losing their finish. Which one is most likely to look \"beaten up\" or messy after a few years of constant use?",
